From 9903337ce2e58694e381e30fe8b1ac519d819eb2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sat, 6 Jun 2026 21:49:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Security hardening: auth, secrets, validation, and RLS

- Require INTEGRATION_SECRET on Railway and engine bridge
- Harden /api/integrations/signals with Zod validation, rate limit, timing-safe auth
- Fix unauthenticated server actions (alerts, holdings sector, Telegram test)
- Restrict broker holdings from pool investors; verify holding ownership on writes
- Timing-safe CRON secret compare; fix auth callback middleware bypass
- Add signal_events RLS policies; complete .env.example files
- Harden stocklens_bridge URL validation and secret handling
- Move drizzle-kit to devDependencies; fix package.json formatting
